What the Junior renderer does not know yet (all optional for rendering):
  - unit.unitMap {root, nodes[{id,label,kind,lesson?,cards[]}], edges[{from,to,label}]}  (concept map)
  - card.id (every card), card.src ("notes" | "textbook p.N"), card.enriched, card.style ("timeline"/"steps")
  - book.intro (header lines), book.intro_cards (whole-book cards), book.source_outline
  - exercise.questions can be more than 15 (all source quiz items kept)
The other 28 books will appear in content/notes/ with the same format.

